isualize </c><00:00:08.376><c>the </c><00:00:08.377><c>activity </c><00:00:08.378><c>in </c><00:00:08.379><c>this </c><00:00:08.380><c>little  </c><00:00:08.381><c>chunk </c><00:00:08.382><c>of </c><00:00:08.383><c>matter </c><00:00:08.384><c>which </c><00:00:08.385><c>is </c><00:00:08.386><c>by </c><00:00:08.387><c>between </c><00:00:08.388><c>all  </c><00:00:08.389><c>of </c><00:00:08.390><c>our </c><00:00:08.391><c>ears</c>

